Oh, no. Ever since His Honor
was reversed in that case,

214
00:12:10,763 --> 00:12:13,376
he hasn't said a
civil word to me.

215
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:16,879
If you don't retract that
immediately, I warn you,

216
